          THE MINIMUM TIME INCREMENT ALLOWED IS                1.000E+05
          THE MAXIMUM TIME INCREMENT ALLOWED IS                1.000E+05

          CREEP AND SWELLING EFFECTS ARE OMITTED IN THIS STEP

